Subject: [PATCH 09/38] fs: sharedfs: probe-only driver

A filesystem whose metadata lives in host memory (see research/16 in the
vm tree). This stage binds virtio device 0x5346, maps shared memory
region 0 with memremap, validates the index header and sets up the one
request virtqueue. No VFS yet.
